 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? That's a tricky moment. It' worth talking, though, even if she's staying somewhere else. No rush on words. What you both need is the space to cool down and think. Pizza for two, pizza for four. Then it' yours keep, and she can have leftovers. Good timing. Start with what's on both of your minds, then ask her what's on hers. Keep it calm, no big dramatic confessions. A short lunch together is a gentle way to start.",
